# Day 49

**0km / 0 hours**

*Whakahoro*

An enforced rest day, as it rained most of the day and thus wasn't safe to go on the river. Very disappointing but at the same time I do understand and the weather is as the weather is. 

![The river in the morning looking brown and unappealing] (./river.avif)

Instead of just staying lonely at the hut the whole day we instead got lifts to a trail host where at least there were interesting people to talk to and such. I won't go into too much detail on this but it's nice that there are people along the way interested in the trail.